  "explanation": "Every node starts its own call with total = 1, counting itself as if it were a link region even when it's a leaf. The recursion terminates, but the total counts nodes rather than edges: this 3-node network prints 3 instead of the intended 2 links.",
  "prompt": "This counts the links joining services in a dependency graph. Step through and predict the count it prints.",
